WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.490
The hat: who offered to take a spot the coordinators fill.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:10.909
Each spot lists who offered, their note, and whether their family is already covered or still short.

00:00:11.109 --> 00:00:14.490
Tap Place. It becomes a normal shift for them.

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:25.060
When the spot fills, everyone else still waiting gets a polite not-picked email, with a link to open shifts. Filled it another way? Close it by hand.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:28.560
Next: background checks.
